WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Rostering → Labour settings with the appropriate management permission.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.208
Step 2: Choose the authorised network, company or location budget scope and save the planned budget settings.

3
00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:18.208
Step 3: Configure effective-dated employee rates where permitted and review missing-rate warnings.

4
00:00:18.208 --> 00:00:24.708
Step 4: Use Positions to add or rename company positions and choose their shift-card colours, then Save positions.
